  "description": "Roslyn-based prompt-injection defence gate for the MCP fleet: statically scans every [McpServerTool] method in the consumer repo and asserts that user-generated content (HTTP bodies, JSON from external APIs, tool output) is wrapped through UntrustedContent.Wrap / UntrustedContent.WrapJson before being returned. Methods can opt in via [ExternalContent] or out via [NotExternalContent]; in their absence a conservative name + return-type + invocation heuristic classifies tools. Per-method exemptions and heuristic overrides via injectionguard.json. Companion to the parallel Mcp.Auth.ResourceServer UntrustedContent helper.",
  "id": "Mcp.InjectionGuard",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-30T22:34:09.96Z",
